Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT、Claude等海外头部大模型突发集体瘫痪超3小时</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌9月4日起停用安卓端Google Assistant，全面切换至Gemini</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于9月4日起正式在安卓手机端停用Google Assistant，并启动用户迁移至Gemini的进程。此次调整覆盖智能手表、耳机及Android Auto等依赖手机智能功能的设备，迁移过程预计持续数周。对于不满足Gemini配置要求的旧设备或未开放地区，Google Assistant将保留一段时间，但大多数用户将在未来一至两个月内失去访问权限。搭载Android的电视、机顶盒及内置Google服务的汽车暂不受影响，后续将通过系统升级完成切换。谷歌此前因完善Gemini功能推迟了原定于2025年底的停用计划。此次变动标志着“嘿，谷歌”交互入口从传统语音助手向生成式AI转型，旨在以Gemini重构Android生态的系统级交互。尽管Gemini能力更强，但在计时器、音乐播放等高频指令的响应稳定性和准确性上仍面</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达129亿美元收购Hugging Face，黄仁勋给出最新承诺</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达129亿美元收购Hugging Face，黄仁勋给出最新承诺AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 4, 202630近日，全球人工智能领域迎来了一场备受瞩目的超级并购。英伟达（NVIDIA）正式宣布，已同意以129.303亿美元(折合约870.92亿元人民币)的价格收购开源人工智能平台 Hugging Face。这一重磅消息瞬间引爆了科技圈，英伟达CEO黄仁勋随后公开发文，详细解释了此次收购的幕后逻辑与未来规划。作为当前全球开源模型开发者的重要聚集地，Hugging Face 已经凝聚了超过1，800万名开发者、研究人员和创作者。平台生态极其繁荣，目前已共享了超过300万个模型、50万个数据集以及100万个应用，同时有超过20万家企业借助该平台寻找、评估、定制和部署人工智能技术</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b86d0f100045a3facaa2d35ab82d7c28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI CEO山姆·奥尔特曼近日证实，公司正同步推进人形机器人与数据中心特种机器人研发。奥尔特曼强调，机器人形态并非核心，关键在于搭载“机器人大脑”，即最新发布的GPT-6 Astra模型。他认为人形设计在处理人类社会环境任务中具备现实意义，但家用场景并非当前首要任务，基础设施与制造业才是落地重点。为支撑硬件研发，OpenAI Robotics事业部正加速扩招，旧金山地区机器人岗位已增至19个，重点聚焦执行器设计、电磁与齿轮设计等硬件底层技术，旨在实现机器人硬件与机器学习的深度协同。尽管目前尚未披露具体发货日期与产量目标，但OpenAI长期看好消费级机器人市场，并致力于通过定制化机电执行器提升硬件的扭矩密度与量产可行性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ffbe77738741cca256b1fa6bd79cba81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 与 Google Research 联合发布 WeatherNext 3 天气预报模型，通过直接输入实时全球静止卫星拼图，解决了传统 AI 模型分辨率低及初始化依赖滞后数据的问题。该模型采用函数生成网络（FGN）网格 Transformer 架构，支持多分辨率输出：最高 0.05°（约 5 公里）的站点级气温与露点，以及 0.1° 的风速、降水与太阳辐射等关键变量。相比前代，WeatherNext 3 刷新频率提升至每小时一次，每天初始化 24 次，并在短时预报中显著提升了降水预测精度，CRPS 指标较基线最高提升 60%。该模型针对可再生能源需求优化，提供 100 米风速及云层分布等数据。目前，用户可通过 BigQuery、Earth Engine 和 Cloud Storag</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT、Claude等海外头部大模型突发集体瘫痪超3小时</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c291c0e954e49b085d2530517daa36f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美东时间9月3日上午9点23分，全球AI领域发生大规模宕机事件，ChatGPT、Claude、Grok、谷歌Gemini及微软Copilot等多款海外头部大模型服务集体瘫痪，故障持续时间长达3小时40分钟，严重影响了海外用户的日常办公与API技术调用。此次突发故障导致海外主流AI服务大面积掉线，而国内大模型在同一时间段内均保持平稳运行。智谱等国内AI企业通过社交平台公开回应称“我们还在线”，侧面印证了国内大模型在底层技术韧性与基础设施承载能力方面的稳定性。此次事件凸显了全球AI服务在集中式架构下的脆弱性，对依赖海外模型进行业务集成的开发者及企业用户而言，基础设施的稳定性与多模型备份策略的重要性再次被推向行业焦点。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
